{{if not .Global.Config.Published}}
> [!TIP]
> To finish publishing your SDK to npm and others you must [run your first generation action](https://www.speakeasy.com/docs/github-setup#step-by-step-guide).
{{end}}

The SDK can be installed with either [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/), [pnpm](https://pnpm.io/), [bun](https://bun.sh/) or [yarn](https://classic.yarnpkg.com/en/) package managers.

### NPM

```bash{{if .Global.Config.Published}}
npm add {{.Global.Config.PackageName}}{{else}}
npm add {{npmInstallURL}}{{end}}
{{- if isReactQueryEnabled }}
# Install optional peer dependencies if you plan to use React hooks
npm add @tanstack/react-query react react-dom
{{- end }}
```

### PNPM

```bash{{if .Global.Config.Published}}
pnpm add {{.Global.Config.PackageName}}{{else}}
pnpm add {{pnpmInstallURL}}{{end}}
{{- if isReactQueryEnabled }}
# Install optional peer dependencies if you plan to use React hooks
pnpm add @tanstack/react-query react react-dom
{{- end }}
```

### Bun

```bash{{if .Global.Config.Published}}
bun add {{.Global.Config.PackageName}}{{else}}
bun add {{default "<UNSET>" .Global.Config.InstallationURL}}{{end}}
{{- if isReactQueryEnabled }}
# Install optional peer dependencies if you plan to use React hooks
bun add @tanstack/react-query react react-dom
{{- end }}
```

### Yarn

```bash{{if .Global.Config.Published}}
yarn add {{.Global.Config.PackageName}}{{else}}
yarn add {{default "<UNSET>" .Global.Config.InstallationURL}}{{end}}
{{- if isReactQueryEnabled }}
# Install optional peer dependencies if you plan to use React hooks
yarn add @tanstack/react-query react react-dom
{{- end }}
```

